      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "An Output is also a buffer: the deep Mandelbrot is drawn once, small, into the first Output, and the second reads its Frame Out twice, tiled behind and turning in the porthole, for the price of two texture reads instead of two fractals. Turn the Mandelbrot's Iterations and only the first Output pays for it."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
